+type: task
+title: "Implement JSON Merge Patch applyMergePatch (RFC 7386)"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Request: implement JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7386) as `applyMergePatch(target, patch)`, exported from
+`src/index.ts`. Returns the merged document as a new value; inputs are not mutated.
+
+Rules: a non-object patch replaces the target; an object patch merges into the target (or into `{}` if
+the target is not an object); `null` members delete; other members merge recursively. Arrays are replaced
+whole. Safe for `__proto__` keys. Tests in `test/mergepatch.test.ts`.
